    "video_file_size": 2756799,
    "caption": "🤖 OpenAI adds GIFs to ChatGPT Images\n\nChatGPT Images 2.6 can turn a text prompt or a picture into an animated GIF. Users can adjust playback speed and edit individual frames. Saved references for themselves, pets, or characters can be reused without uploading them again.\n\nFor developers, GPT-Image-2.6 Flare and Sunburst are available through the API. Image generation is 50% faster. Flare produces images in 6 seconds, while Sunburst delivers higher quality and keeps edits more consistent. Image markup and SVG export are also supported.\n\nImages 2.6 is available in ChatGPT and Codex on all plans. The 2 new models are available in the API.\n\n📊@tech",
